OL,3,CThird man charged with murder after
OL,4,Cstabbing
OL,6,FA third man has been charged with
OL,7,Fmurder after a man died in Stoke-on-
OL,8,FTrent.
OL,10,FStaffordshire Police have now charged
OL,11,FHassan Ahmed, 19, from Stoke-on-Trent,
OL,12,Falongside Dhannish Mahmood, 19, and
OL,13,FSubhan Nadeem, 20.
OL,15,FEmergency services were called to
OL,16,FRidgway Road in Shelton at 7.40pm on
OL,17,FJuly 23rd after reports of a man being
OL,18,Fstabbed.
OL,20,FThey found 44-year-old Christopher
OL,21,FBradbury, who died at the scene.
